    "detailed_description": "SoTo is a challenging game which you need a good plan to pass safely through the path of enemies. In order to collect the keys and unlock the locks,  you need to adjust your timing well. <br><br>...<br><br>Keys are the primary gameplay elements of SoTo.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You need the <u><strong>correct</strong></u> key for each lock.<br></li><li> If you have a key when you collide with the enemy, you won't lose a <u><strong>life</strong></u> but the key will drop.<br></li><li> By leaving a key on the enemy's path, you can <u><strong>block</strong></u> the enemy from moving and open a safe route for yourself.</li></ul><br>Controls: WASD, Arrows, Controller<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/717960/extras/0252d0e1e6eb16e6d8a8758a49b0007b.avif?t=1624358887\" /></div>",
